OL,3,GNEWSAThe men getting their nails
OL,4,Apainted for mental health campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp until recently, Sam Clements had
OL,7,Fonly ever had his nails painted by his
OL,8,Fnine-year-old daughter.
OL,10,FBut on Thursday, the 37-year-old went
OL,11,Fwith three other members of the Ross
OL,12,FRunners running club to get his nails
OL,13,Fpainted at the Khaos Nail Bar in
OL,14,FRoss-on-Wye.
OL,16,FThe nail bar is participating in the
OL,17,Fnational campaign Hard As Nails,
OL,18,Fencouraging men to get their nails
OL,19,Fpainted and keep it on for seven days
OL,20,Fin a bid to inspire conversations
OL,21,Faround men's mental health.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
