OL,3,GNEWSAThe men getting their nails
OL,4,Apainted for mental health campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorgie Hughes, the co-owner of the
OL,7,Fnail bar, told the BBC: "The idea is
OL,8,Fthat something as simple as painted
OL,9,Fnails can spark bigger conversations
OL,10,Faround male mental health and about
OL,11,Fhaving healthy masculinity and breaking
OL,12,Fdown stereotypes.
